abstract: >
  A dynamic input-output Leontief model with a flexible accelerator for
  analyzing the macroeconomic impact of the vehicle recycling fee hike in
  Russia. The model removes the pathological instability of the classical
  Leontief dynamic model and provides quantitatively different adaptation
  times across policy scenarios (growth, stagnation, crisis). Empirical
  calibration uses the 2021 Russian input-output tables published by Rosstat.